    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Storage",
        "extra": [
          "\n\n",
          "Collecting goods is great and all  but you also need place to store them right ? ",
          "\n",
          "Depending on your resources, you can create different storage blocks with varying amounts of space within them.",
          "\n\n",
          "Storage Pot :",
          "\n",
          "The storage pot is the most basic form of storage block",
          "\n",
          "it can store 1 type of item and can only store up to the stack limit",
          "\n",
          "R-Click with item to store it inside ",
          "\n",
          "Shift+R-Click to retrive the items"
        ]
      },
      "width": 250
    }
  ],
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "pause": false,
  "after_action": "none",
  "yes": {
    "label": "Close",
    "action": {
      "type": "minecraft:run_command",
